abstract: "Search 138,262 US drug products from the FDA National Drug Code (NDC) Directory via openFDA: brand and generic name, labeler, dosage form, route, marketing category, DEA schedule, active ingredients with strength, pharmacologic class, UNII and RxCUI. Embedded data, no scraping, pay per record."
